stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Plugged

    Plugged --> SlacMatching : AC any measurement, DC duty in (4,7)
    Plugged --> SlacMatching : after a charger stop, 2 s, then running PWM in any mode
    Plugged --> Plugged : DC, duty in (7,97) arms iso_pwm_wait_s once
    Plugged --> Faulted : PWM deadline, DC Internal "no 5 % PWM"
    Plugged --> [*] : StopSession while a restart waits, held

    note right of SlacMatching
        MCS: CP C for 4 s, then B,
        then trigger_matching. No deadline: an UNMATCHED
        after MATCHING resets and triggers again while
        the pilot is B, C or D.
    end note

    SlacMatching --> V2GNegotiating : SlacState=MATCHED
    SlacMatching --> [*] : StopSession, held in Plugged with CP B

    V2GNegotiating --> Charging : IsoPowerReady (AC)
    V2GNegotiating --> Charging : IsoDcPowerOn / dc_power_on (DC)
    V2GNegotiating --> V2GNegotiating : IsoPowerReady (DC, CP=C + power-on, await dc_power_on)
    V2GNegotiating --> Stopping : IsoStopFromCharger / StopSession (live session)
    V2GNegotiating --> [*] : StopSession (no session), held in Plugged with CP B
    V2GNegotiating --> [*] : IsoV2GFinished, held without a session, V2GTimeout report
    V2GNegotiating --> Faulted : StateDeadline (60s resume PWM wait only, V2GTimeout)

    Charging --> Paused : PauseSession / IsoPauseFromCharger
    Charging --> Stopping : StopSession / IsoStopFromCharger
    Charging --> Plugged : IsoV2GFinished, SLAC reset, same session awaits a PWM wake-up after 2 s
    Charging --> Faulted : InternalFault

    Paused --> BcbToggling : ResumeSession (no live ISO session, seeds bcb_remaining=6, via X1 wait)
    Paused --> Paused : ResumeSession (ISO session live, defer + arm 15s fallback)
    Paused --> BcbToggling : IsoV2GFinished (release deferred resume, via X1 wait)
    Paused --> BcbToggling : StateDeadline (15s deferred-resume fallback, no X1 wait)
    Paused --> Paused : X1 wait, a released resume while PWM runs after an EV pause (15s bound from the session end)
    Paused --> Paused : ResumeSession / BcbToggle while one is pending (Rejected ack)
    Paused --> BcbToggling : BspMeasurement PWM off (X1) / StateDeadline (15s bound, best effort)
    Paused --> V2GNegotiating : charger pause, IsoV2GFinished, 2 s, then running PWM (no BCB, no SLAC)
    Paused --> Paused : no resume pending, X1 seen or the 15s bound passes (re-arm 1h watchdog)
    Paused --> Stopping : StateDeadline (1h watchdog, from the pause or its re-arm) / StopSession (live session)
    Paused --> [*] : StopSession (no session), held in Plugged with CP B
    Paused --> Faulted : InternalFault

    BcbToggling --> V2GNegotiating : 6x StateDeadline (link kept, DC D-LINK_PAUSE)
    BcbToggling --> SlacMatching : 6x StateDeadline + slac_unmatched (re-match)
    BcbToggling --> Stopping : StopSession (live session)
    BcbToggling --> [*] : StopSession (no session), held in Plugged with CP B
    BcbToggling --> Faulted : InternalFault

    Stopping --> Stopping : IsoPowerDeliveryStopped, power off and CP B (not MCS)
    Stopping --> [*] : IsoV2GFinished / StateDeadline (10s), held without a session
    Stopping --> Plugged : charger stop, SLAC reset, same session awaits a PWM wake-up after 2 s
    Stopping --> Faulted : InternalFault

    note right of Paused
        CP held at C while an ISO session is still
        tearing down (not for ISO 15118-20 AC), lowered to
        B when the SECC accepts PowerDelivery(Stop)
        (IsoPowerDeliveryStopped).
        IsoV2GFinished re-asserts B for a session that
        ends without one.
    end note
